    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d53">

                <pb facs="0123" n="63" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg63"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is understood that a British force has occupied the island of Trinidad off the
                    coast. Representations have been made by the Government to Great Britain and a
                    war vessel dispatched to the island.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
